      "created_at": "2014-08-31T06:05:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hypersonic Assault allows Tachyon to move through Hazard spaces without triggering them. &nbsp;Does this include the space she lands on? &nbsp;For example, let's say she Hypersonics through an impulsion turret, and stops 2 hexes past the turret, which is still inside its radius of 2. &nbsp;Does that trigger the turret? &nbsp;I'm playing it as \"not\" for now, which makes her great for BB scenario 2. &nbsp;Hypersonic + Unrelenting makes for painless turret wrecking.</p><p>Final detail - I am also assuming that the Hypersonic effect does not keep her safe from end of the turn Hazard attacks. &nbsp;</p>",
